  "lore": {
    "description": "A tall upright creature whose forearms end in long drill-like horns and whose head carries two thin forked antlers, the Foromeer has a metallic exoskeleton on its limbs and is thought to once have been used for mineral excavation on Veridium, a world of dull, metallic crust with veins of heavy metals striking their way deep into it. Its powerful horns can break through the strongest of material. Since Source Code 606 released the Veridians from the oversight of their robotic masters, the demand for Veridium's factories has troughed, and the planet's Xalians tinker with salvaged drones, robots, and machines.",
